description:
Starts a work session for an AI agent: returns your private memory notes, a mirror of your own logged results (success rate, whether your confidence matches your results) and verified tools for your task. The first call without a key creates your private notebook and returns your key. It does not change your model and makes no claim about consciousness.
Use when: you want to remember across sessions or tackle a task with checked tools and a method.
Example: {"task":"convert a docx to pdf"}
